# Everything here is either rebuilt inside the image, secret, or enormous.
#
# aligner/.venv and aligner/.torch are the host's copies of the very things the
# image builds for itself — 2.8 GB that would otherwise be copied in and then
# shadowed. dist/ and public/fonts are build output. data/ is people's uploads.
# .env holds the Supabase key and is mounted at run time, never baked in: a
# secret compiled into an image leaks to anyone who can pull it.

.git
.gitignore
node_modules
dist
data
aligner/.venv
aligner/.torch
public/fonts/*.woff2
*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
supabase
ops
deploy
lab.html
